71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vddUNEhqUpQQ7kNvwFwK395&_nc_oc=AdptrZnGSFiUoUigictnb3YeeAB3es8lAH5-O4bcKY8CNrKSvS_mtnOKhLr9mCnn3Ks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAtd7nkIqD2BhrCho6Kxpbv1dz8GRvOXrEjKo1ERpchDg&oe=6A660739"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y4Elav7nwGUQ7kNvwHPMW2y&_nc_oc=Adqzqx-R8JQruwA6TJyzOs4v2JbtTO6bmkK36S99Ussg9sUetzPjAYi-nyLMhv-yRBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDGhKItu38XEfLUiaWPuXBP9NPzJszzOAHmz3n9262Dxw&oe=6A661A13"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53iy9b3sYEkQ7kNvwGkzUaJ&_nc_oc=AdoP5wVuY_kAyHB11A0lj-YFYtu7KKcy9K9WUacQPno6w51-Ombe4KfJE76XUiG6TZw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAyZL7wDmD2cYOfJ4p4ChMXPeJ5rYD4z8QfjXnZsHvC_g&oe=6A66185A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: